 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Tocopherol, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Bisabolol, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Silica, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract</paragraph>
               </text>
